                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Rage Coffee's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Specific positioning (plant-vitamin infused flavoured coffee) + Shark Tank halo + subscription mechanics. Category creation with accessible-premium bridge.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new coffee brands compete with Rage?</h3>
